    "title": "Maricopa County Sheriff's Office to take part in Waddell town hall - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago The Arizona LD29 Republicans are hosting a town hall with members of the Maricopa County Sheriff’s Office tomorrow in Waddell.\nTopics will cover community concerns and public safety and will include an open forum for questions, concerns and feedback\nIt is set for 6 to 8 p.m. at Mountain View School, 18302 W Burton Ave., Waddell.\nA Spanish interpreter will be available for accessibility to all community members.",
